      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would be fine just having a double and a float version. It seems unlikely that we\u0027d be using non-floating point vectors in this way. (If we were using integer vectors to represent things, they\u0027d likely be fixed point and then I\u0027m not sure if passing them to std::sqrt would behave as expected).",
